---
// src/components/features/landing/comp-cases.astro
---
<section id="cases" class="snap-section cases-section">
  <a href="#top" class="back-to-top" aria-label="Volver al inicio" title="Volver al inicio">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path>
    </svg>
  </a>

  <div class="container cases-container">
    
    <!-- Encabezado de Sección con Gráfico de Tendencia Neón -->
    <div class="section-header-cases">
      <div class="header-cases-texts">
        <div class="cases-badge">
          <span class="cases-badge-icon-box">🏆</span>
          <span class="cases-badge-text">PRUEBA SOCIAL</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title-cases">Resultados que Hablan con <span class="italic-title">Números</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle-cases">Casos reales de transformación digital que multiplican los prospectos de pequeños negocios.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="header-cases-visual">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 320 180" class="cases-trend-chart" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="trend-grad-cases" x1="0%" y1="100%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--color-accent-primary)" stop-opacity="0.2" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--color-accent-primary)" stop-opacity="1" />
            </linearGradient>
            <filter id="glow-orange-cases" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="5" result="blur" />
              <feComposite in="SourceGraphic" in2="blur" operator="over" />
            </filter>
          </defs>
          <!-- Barras de fondo -->
          <rect x="50" y="80" width="16" height="70" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.08" />
          <rect x="95" y="65" width="16" height="85" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.12" />
          <rect x="140" y="55" width="16" height="95" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.15" />
          <rect x="185" y="40" width="16" height="110" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.18" />
          <rect x="230" y="28" width="16" height="122" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.22" />
          <rect x="275" y="15" width="16" height="135" rx="3" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" opacity="0.26" />
          
          <!-- Línea con glow -->
          <path d="M20,140 Q70,120 120,80 T220,60 T300,20" fill="none" stroke="url(#trend-grad-cases)" stroke-width="4.5" filter="url(#glow-orange-cases)" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <!-- Flecha de tendencia -->
          <path d="M288,17 L304,18 L298,34 Z" fill="var(--color-accent-primary)" filter="url(#glow-orange-cases)" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cases-grid">
      <!-- Caso 1 (Caso Real) -->
      <div class="case-card glass-panel">
        <div class="case-header-row">
          <div class="case-icon-box">🛒</div>
          <div class="case-industry-block">
            <span class="case-industry">E-Commerce / Distribuidora</span>
            <span class="case-type-badge real">Caso Real</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">Maíz del Sol</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">Una tienda tradicional de productos latinos con una plataforma móvil lenta que dificultaba las ventas. Rediseñamos su presencia completa a una SPA estática ultrarrápida con Astro. Optimizamos la carga móvil eliminando toda fricción técnica y visual.</p>
        
        <div class="case-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle speed">⚡</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">0.8s</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Carga en celular</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle trend">📈</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">+28%</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Conversión estimada</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Caso 2 (Modelo Ilustrativo - Destacado) -->
      <div class="case-card glass-panel featured-case">
        <div class="case-header-row">
          <div class="case-icon-box highlighted-icon">📞</div>
          <div class="case-industry-block">
            <span class="case-industry">Servicios Locales / Contratistas</span>
            <span class="case-type-badge model">Modelo Ilustrativo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">Captura de Llamadas Perdidas</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">Muchos negocios tradicionales pierden llamadas activas mientras los técnicos operan en ruta. Implementamos un sistema automático de respuesta interactiva por WhatsApp/SMS que asiste al cliente al instante y agenda citas directamente en el calendario del equipo.</p>
        
        <div class="case-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle check">✓</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">+45%</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Citas recuperadas</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle clock">⏰</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">15 hrs</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Tiempo mensual ahorrado</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Caso 3 (Modelo Ilustrativo) -->
      <div class="case-card glass-panel">
        <div class="case-header-row">
          <div class="case-icon-box">👤</div>
          <div class="case-industry-block">
            <span class="case-industry">Consultoría / Profesionales</span>
            <span class="case-type-badge model">Modelo Ilustrativo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="case-title">Posicionamiento de Autoridad</h3>
        <p class="case-desc">Profesionales independientes que dependían exclusivamente del boca en boca para captar clientes. Diseñamos una landing page enfocada en su cliente ideal (ICP), posicionando su trayectoria y atrayendo leads de alto ticket en mercados bilingües.</p>
        
        <div class="case-stats">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle group">👥</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">12/mes</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Prospectos cualificados</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-icon-circle trend-blue">📈</span>
            <div class="stat-text-group">
              <span class="stat-number">3x</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Retorno estimado</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de Propuesta Inferior -->
    <div class="cases-action-bar glass-panel">
      <div class="action-phone-box">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" width="20" height="20">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.94.725l.548 2.2a1 1 0 01-.321.988l-1.305.98a10.582 10.582 0 004.872 4.872l.98-1.305a1 1 0 01.988-.321l2.2.548a1 1 0 01.725.94V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="action-texts">
        <h4 class="action-title">¿Quieres saber cómo podemos lograr estos resultados en <span class="highlight-q-text">tu negocio</span>?</h4>
        <p class="action-desc">Agendemos una llamada de descubrimiento gratuita.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="action-button-block">
        <a href="#audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-action-audit">
          <span>Medir la salud de mi negocio &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <span class="action-lock-notice">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" width="11" height="11">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 9V7a5 5 0 0110 0v2a2 2 0 012 2v5a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-5a2 2 0 012-2zm8-2v2H7V7a3 3 0 016 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Sin compromiso - 100% confidencial
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de Características Inferior -->
    <div class="hero-features-bar glass-panel" id="cases-features-bar">
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">⚡</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong class="feature-title">Rápido y sencillo</strong>
          <span class="feature-desc">Completa en solo 2 minutos y obtén tu diagnóstico.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">🎯</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong class="feature-title">Resultados inmediatos</strong>
          <span class="feature-desc">Recibe un análisis personalizado al finalizar.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">🛡️</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong class="feature-title">100% Gratis</strong>
          <span class="feature-desc">Sin tarjetas, sin trampas. Solo valor real.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-item">
        <div class="feature-icon-box">👥</div>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <strong class="feature-title">Hecho para emprendedores</strong>
          <span class="feature-desc">Entendemos tu negocio, hablamos tu idioma.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cases-section {
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-slow);
    position: relative;
    padding: 2rem 0 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .back-to-top {
    position: absolute;
    top: 2rem;
    right: 2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .back-to-top:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-card-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .cases-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Encabezado con tendencia neón */
  .section-header-cases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    width: 100%;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-cases-texts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cases-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.15rem;
    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.45);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    white-space: nowrap;
    width: max-content;
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .cases-badge {
    background-color: rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.15);
  }

  .cases-badge-text {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .cases-badge-text {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .section-title-cases {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .italic-title {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .section-subtitle-cases {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .header-cases-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cases-trend-chart {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 170px;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* Grid de Tarjetas */
  .cases-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .case-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast), box-shadow var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .case-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .featured-case {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.1);
  }

  :global([data-theme="brand"]) .featured-case {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.08);
  }

  .case-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .case-icon-box {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), background-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .case-icon-box.highlighted-icon {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.15);
  }

  .case-industry-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .case-industry {
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .case-type-badge {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .case-type-badge.real {
    background-color: rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.1);
    color: #2ec4b6;
    border: 1px solid rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.2);
  }

  .case-type-badge.model {
    background-color: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1);
    color: #00b4d8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.2);
  }

  .case-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .case-desc {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.42;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Estadísticas inferiores de cada tarjeta */
  .case-stats {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .stat-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 50%;
  }

  .stat-icon-circle {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.725rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.speed {
    background-color: rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.1);
    color: #2ec4b6;
    border: 1px solid rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.trend {
    background-color: rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.1);
    color: #2ec4b6;
    border: 1px solid rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.check {
    background-color: rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.1);
    color: #2ec4b6;
    border: 1px solid rgba(46, 196, 182, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.clock {
    background-color: rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.group {
    background-color: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1);
    color: #00b4d8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-icon-circle.trend-blue {
    background-color: rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1);
    color: #00b4d8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.2);
  }

  .stat-text-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Barra de Acción de propuesta */
  .cases-action-bar {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  html[data-theme="brand"] .cases-action-bar {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent-primary); /* Borde azul oscuro de la paleta en modo claro */
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27, 42, 86, 0.08);
  }

  .action-phone-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary-text);
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .action-texts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    flex-grow: 1;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .action-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .highlight-q-text {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .action-desc {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .action-button-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .btn-action-audit {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .action-lock-notice {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  #cases-features-bar {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .section-header-cases {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header-cases-texts {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header-cases-visual {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .cases-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .cases-action-bar {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .action-texts {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .action-button-block {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .btn-action-audit {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .section-title-cases {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }
    .back-to-top {
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
